Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.23,0:01:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 莱希 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Lacie! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.67,0:02:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.60,0:02:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我拿着炸弹呢 - 你搞毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was holding a bomb! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.69,0:02:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:31.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,房东今天会让买家过来 所以 你给我裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Landlord is sending buyers over today so… put your pants on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.44,0:02:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我不穿裤子的话 也许能吓跑他们 我们就能留下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe if I don't, it'll scare 'em off and we can stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不行 赖安 租约还有四周就到期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not an option, Ryan. Lease is up in four weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.16,0:02:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我这是在为你考虑 我有地方去的好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm thinking of you. I've got somewhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳特的室友在凤凰城找了份工作 所以他的房间归我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nate's roommate took a job in Phoenix so I get his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.95,0:02:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 你慢了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Now who's the slow poke?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.72,0:02:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 午餐时间我会去看房的 迟点再聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm… seeing some places over lunch. Catch you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.96,0:03:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那是我姐姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, that was my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.23,0:03:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对 我知道你想上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I bet you'd love to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.18,0:03:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,茉莉花茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jasmine tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.92,0:03:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一份磨砂奶咖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's one Brushed Suede.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.76,0:03:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要一块饼干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a cookie with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.72,0:03:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 免费哦 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's on the house. - Sounds awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.92,0:03:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- JJ 明天见 - 明天见 莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you tomorrow, JJ. - See you, Lacie.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见你孩子戴着消防帽的视频了 真是可爱到爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I saw your boy in the fire hat just now! So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 他可厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lacie!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 贝茨 见到你真高兴 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bets, it's great to see you! - You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,煎饼怎么样啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Pancakes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,它超级搞笑 特别好玩 全世界最棒的喵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hilarious. Such a funny cat. Just the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.26,0:05:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还在霍迪卡吗 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you still at Hoddicker? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 那里挺好的 - 那可真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. It's going pretty great. - Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以你怎么回来了 - 新工作 第一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what brings you back here? - New job, first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 第一天吗 - 在布兰克曼-哈珀尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- First day? - At Blankman-Harper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 顶层诶 那可真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Top floor! That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你好运 - 我懂的 哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, good luck. - I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.91,0:06:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你在霍迪卡这么开心 真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great you're still happy at Hoddicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 暂时的啦 - 对 暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, maybe not forever. - No, not forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.56,0:06:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只是现在还在 - 对 现在而已 没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But for now… - It's OK for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在在那里挺好的 是的 挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great for now, yes. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱希 我给你买了一杯冰沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lacie, I got you a smoothie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.25,0:07:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实给大家都买了 但是还有一大堆剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got one for everyone, actually. Still a bunch of them for grabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.24,0:07:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是农贸市场的有机货摊那边卖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're from the organic stall at the farmers' market.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.65,0:07:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在不怎么和切斯说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're kind of not talking to Ches.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 3.1分 发生了什么 - 他和戈登分手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 3.1? What happened? - Him and Gordon split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.62,0:07:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可怜的切斯 - 不 不 不 我们是站在戈登那边的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Poor Ches. - No, no, no, we're all on Gordon's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure! Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.79,0:07:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,切斯在拍马屁 想要腆着脸回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ches is kissing ass. Trying to scrape himself back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.46,0:08:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 要是掉到二点五分以下 那就拜拜啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, if it drops below two-five, then it's… bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.89,0:08:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哟 他们要买 - 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo, they're taking it. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.29,0:08:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,房东找来的那对夫妻 我听到他们说要买下这房子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The couple the landlord sent over. I heard them talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.56,0:08:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.08,0:08:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 现在我们进入了日光厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now we move into the light space area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里跟心爱之人共度甜蜜时光最适合不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ideal for special times with loved ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,美食满桌 佳人相伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great food, great company.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你上传的照片合成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sampled your photo stream to make her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.59,0:09:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好棒的发型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小区成员专用的沙龙提供的免费造型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Styled free of charge at the members' salon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他还好啦 - 公寓不配送男朋友哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's okay. - He doesn't come with the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是附近有酒吧和餐厅 只限租客使用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is a bar and restaurant on site, tenants only.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们营造的无与伦比的浪漫氛围能让爱情轻易萌芽\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have unparalleled metrics on romantic geneses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得告诉你 这的房子可是特别抢手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta say, these places are going like "that."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.40,0:09:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是你感兴趣的话就千万别迟疑 - 噢 我可不止是感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So don't delay if you're interested. - Oh, I'm more than interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.81,0:09:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少六个月的标准租约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standard occupancy on a minimum six-month contract,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,价格大概是 这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're talking… this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.43,0:09:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多久交一次啊 - 这是每周的租金\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How often are the payments? - That's weekly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:09:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.20,0:09:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比想象中的多一点对吧 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A little more than expected? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.76,0:09:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是有商量余地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's options.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们的精英领袖项目吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know our Prime Influencers Programme?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我算是精英吗 - 不 不 不 你不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I qualify for that? - No. No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,4.5分左右才算\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd need you around a 4.5.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.33,0:10:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,4.5分吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}4.5?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了4.5分就能打八折\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit 4.5 and there's a 20% discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 4.5分 - 对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 4.5. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹈鹕湾 那是什么 什么优生项目吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelican Cove? What is this? A eugenics programme?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一个生活社区 - 没有人会这么开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A lifestyle community. - No one is this happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个拿着气球的两岁小孩都不可能开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}A two-year-old with a fucking balloon isn't this happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.48,0:11:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里其实蛮有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually a pretty cool place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.68,0:11:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够格住进去么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you'd even qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无能为力 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.42,0:11:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是有希望的 你明显是个勇于尝试的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's not hopeless, you're clearly a tryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.29,0:11:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你光看看我就有这样的感觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the sense you get just from… me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看的是你的口碑报告分析\N{\fnArial\fs30}From your rep report analytics.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我们深度分析你的数据 你的人气弧相当扎实\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we drill down into the numbers, you've got a solid popularity arc here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:12:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,整体趋势很强 让我们看看最近二十四小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strong overall trajectory. Let's just look at the last 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 甚至\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, even…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.60,0:12:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 早上8点40分 你在社交平台上很努力啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that? 8:40 a.m. You're working hard on your socials.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.64,0:12:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好的一步尝试 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great little uptake there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.60,0:12:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有几个小差评啊 你在开车的时候超人车了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of minor dings there. You cut someone off in traffic?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.96,0:12:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 只是工作上的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, just a workplace thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我们看看你的影响范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Let's check on your sphere of influence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.13,0:12:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看大范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me zoom out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,周边关系很好啊 陌生人喜欢你 加分哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great peripherals. Strangers like you, that's a plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.63,0:12:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好友圈子也很健康 很好 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Healthy inner circle. It's good. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.71,0:12:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有很长的路要走 但是4.5分绝对是有可能达到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a ways to go, but 4.5 is certainly achievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.23,0:12:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得得花多久呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达到4.5分吗 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To hit 4.5? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.98,0:12:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果能避免重大挫折\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, barring a major setback,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,被当众羞辱之类的事 大概一年半左右吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}a public disgrace kind of deal, I'd say 18 months or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 我需要短期就能提升 要很短\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I need more short term. Like… much more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.69,0:12:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你需要一点助推了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you'll need a boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么样的助推 - 这个嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What kind of a boost? - Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.53,0:12:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大部分的社交都局限在你的好友圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of your interactions are confined to your inner circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.45,0:13:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他们大部分都是 原谅我的用词 中下层的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're largely, pardon the term, mid-to low-range folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.13,0:13:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的社交外围圈也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same with your outer circle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.36,0:13:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一堆来自服务行业的工人的互相五星好评\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a ton of reciprocal five stars from service industry workers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是除此之外就没别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's not much else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.54,0:13:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少目前是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least as far as I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你需要在质量方面做出提升\N{\fnArial\fs30}So in terms of quality, you could use a punch up right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好是就是从优质的人那里得到好评\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ideally, that's up votes from quality people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 优质的人 - 评分在四星高分段的精英\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Quality people? - High fours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.92,0:13:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,打动那些高端人群 你的人气弧就能一下上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impress those up-scale folks, you'll gain velocity on your arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.58,0:13:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你需要的助推\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's your boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 JJ - 嗨 莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hi, JJ! - Hey, Lacie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 基思 你好 - 莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keith! Hello. - Lacie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今天好漂亮 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look great today. - Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.06,0:13:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 门不开 我现在才2.4分 - 对不起 切斯 我迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Door won't open. I'm on 2.4. - Sorry, Ches. I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.15,0:13:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要几颗星星 求求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need some stars, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,卧槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 嗨 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hi! - Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 布兰克曼那怎么样 - 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going at Blankman? - Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.86,0:14:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 我就知道你在那会干得 挺好的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I bet you work… good there. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.58,0:14:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要来一个羊角面包吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like a croissant?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.58,0:14:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡店多给了我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave me an extra at the coffee place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢不用了 我吃过了 - 噢 好吧 没事 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, I already ate. - Okay, sure. All good. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.98,0:14:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我到了 那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here's me, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用力过猛了 卑躬屈膝不可能赢得尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try too hard. It's impossible to respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,四星精英们老远就能看出来了 做自己就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}High fours can smell it a mile off. Just be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,真诚的表现 这才是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Authentic gestures, that's the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.49,0:14:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 晚点再联系你 - 噢 我能不能问一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's time up, I'll catch you later. - Oh, could I just ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.60,0:16:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,“破布先生”\N{\fnArial\fs30}… "Mr. Rags."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.36,0:16:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这特么是什么玩意 - 橄榄酱 来点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the fuck is that? - Tapenade. Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.39,0:17:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who even are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.24,0:17:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想吃了 赖安\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just something I wanna eat, Ryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 奈奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Naomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,经典 完美的奈奥米 你们还在联系吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Old school, el perfecto Naomi? You guys keep in contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖安 你走开 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryan, just go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.42,0:17:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天 - 奈奈 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God! - Nay-Nay, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是随便做点小零食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just fixing myself a snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 莱希 我能说我看到你好高兴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Lace, could I just say I am so happy to see your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也是啊 我们已经有 - 有很久不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me too. It's been… - Too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太久了 - 都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Way too long. - And that's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.40,0:17:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 怪我 就是平时太 - 平时太\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, it's mine. Everything is just so… - Everything's just so…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:50.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天忙到爆 看见你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy! Oh, it's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.83,0:17:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你上传了那张破布先生的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you posted that Mr. Rags photo…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.14,0:17:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 破布先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Mr. Rags!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须给你打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just had to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:18:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你聊聊 因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}and talk to you because…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好大的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! That's a… big ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.24,0:18:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜 你嫁给的是 保罗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations! Who's the, um… Paul?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.00,0:18:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很棒 非常聪明 又贴心\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is great. So smart. Just sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会很喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're gonna love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.52,0:18:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 不论如何 重头日是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anyways, the big day…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, when is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们下个月就要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we're getting married in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.13,0:18:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这个岛上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on his family's estate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他家的庄园办婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}up here on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在忍冬的玛丽港外 你听说过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place outside Port Mary, Honeysuckle. You heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这是个私人小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a private island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.00,0:18:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a looooook!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.93,0:18:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow! That is…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 嗯 所以 你能来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, right? So… can you make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.52,0:18:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗 当然能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 真好 我在想 如果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great, cool, cos I was wondering if…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.39,0:18:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱希 你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lace, do you think…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.26,0:18:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意做我的首席伴娘吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you be my maid of honour?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.65,0:18:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 你现在都有那么棒的朋友了 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you've got such cool friends now. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.21,0:19:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我们11岁的时候 策划着我们梦想的婚礼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when we used to plan our dream weddings when we were, like, 11?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.13,0:19:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道 但我们这么久没 - 我不知道 看见破布先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know but we haven't s… - I don't know, just seeing Mr. Rags…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.83,0:19:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的记忆都回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the memories. It just brought things home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 奈奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Nay-Nay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我们很久很久没有联系了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we haven't kept in touch as much as I'd have liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.13,0:19:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,全怪我 但那天非常重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that is totally my fault, but this is a big day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一生中屈指可数的大日子 我希望我的老朋友在我身边 交情最久的老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big life day and I want my oldest friend with me, my oldest friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.12,0:19:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you by my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I have to…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 主要是致辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much to it. A speech, mainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,致辞 当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speech? Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼 会有多少人出席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. How big's the crowd?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢天哪 大概有 - 几百人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my gosh, like… - hundreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是份疯狂的宾客名单 我现在发给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a crazy guest list. I'll send it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.68,0:19:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,保罗邀请了好多人 我不想说他们有什么了不起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paul's invited so many, I don't want to call them big deals,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们都是4.7分 或者更高\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they're all, like, 4.7 or above.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奈 我不会让你失望的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nay-Nay, I will not let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.71,0:20:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太紧张 就说说从前的回忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't sweat too much! Just talk about old memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 说说我们的过去 那些故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. - How we were, any old things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.19,0:20:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 懂了 - 我会发给你一些过往的趣事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gotcha. - I'll ping you some anecdotes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太好了 - 你穿几号的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That would be great. - And what's your dress size?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.65,0:20:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.64,0:20:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就直接给你件4号的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, I'll just send you a four.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.97,0:20:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 完美 - 我们有相配的伴娘礼服\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Perfect. - We got matching bridesmaids dresses.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.24,0:20:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.21,0:20:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你哦 小莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, Lay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 奈奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Nay-Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.99,0:20:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.33,0:20:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么 F开头的词吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that? The F-word?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个小娘们儿又好上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two pussy pals now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.99,0:20:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她对你一直很刻薄 - 不 她没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She was always mean to you. - No, she wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:21:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她写的那首诗 - 那只是个玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She had that rhyme about you. - That was a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.20,0:21:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那她剪你头发呢 - 我让她剪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about when she cut your hair? - I asked her to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.64,0:21:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她睡了格雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}She fucked Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.75,0:21:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 她没睡格雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… did not fuck Greg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.32,0:21:17.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真火辣 这个我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}She looked hot. I'll give her that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.61,0:21:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.68,0:21:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼 天哪 嗯 可以可以 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. Jesus. Yeah, that'd do it. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是鹈鹕湾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelican Cove.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔 我是莱希 昨天去看的房 我要租下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carole, it's Lacie. Saw the place yesterday. I wanna take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 你现在还是4.2分 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Oh, I see you're still on a 4.2. Is that, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我决定了 现在就把押金打过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, I'm on it, just gonna transfer the deposit now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.97,0:21:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 好的 - 耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, okay. - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:22:00.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个世界上 我们都过于关注自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this world, we're all so caught up in our own heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,却容易忽视那些真实的 重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy to lose sight of what's real. What matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.05,0:22:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今天当我站在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as I stand here today…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.28,0:22:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了保罗给奈奥米的生活带来的欢乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing the joy Paul has brought to Naomi's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.69,0:22:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她对我来说真的很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she's someone who truly matters to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.34,0:22:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nay-Nay,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们在艺术夏令营里 只是才五岁的小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}the little girl who, when we were just five-years-old in art camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她主动和我聊天 只因为她看见我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}started talking to me because she saw I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.96,0:22:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她帮我制作了破布先生 我到现在依然保存着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl who helped me make Mr. Rags. I still have him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他坐在我的桌子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sits on my desk and…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.74,0:22:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天他都令我想起奈奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day, he reminds me of Nay-Nay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.17,0:23:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是当初还是现在 她对我都很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What she meant to me then and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常荣幸来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so honored to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.38,0:23:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你从此一生幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I wish you all the happiness this stupid world can muster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.81,0:23:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 奈奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Nay-Nay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.87,0:23:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,流眼泪是不是有点夸张啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the tear too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个神经病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking sociopath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.45,0:23:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赖安 我的车到了 太过了吗 - 什么 眼泪 照片 破布先生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ryan, my car's here. Was it too much? - What, the tear, the photo, Mr. Rags?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.68,0:23:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确一直把他放在桌子上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do keep him on my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.33,0:23:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,甜言蜜语是一回事 把人甜出糖尿病就太过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's sugary and then there's fucking diabetes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.93,0:23:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只不过想让她在结婚的日子里开心些\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna make her happy on her wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.15,0:23:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,让无法走开的四分精英用五星好评把你淹没\N{\fnArial\fs30}The captive audience of 4-point holies five-starring your ass off,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.29,0:23:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是附加奖励 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's just a bonus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.39,0:23:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奈奥米和我曾经是最好的朋友 - 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Naomi and I were best friends. - Come on…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.71,0:23:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望她一切都好 我想尽我所能的表达我的情感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish her well and wanna express it the best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.78,0:23:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 如果我成功致辞了 得到几百个精英人士给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yeah, if I nail a speech and get five-starred.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.20,0:23:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,五星好评 那又如何呢 这可是双赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}by hundreds of primes, so what? It's a win-win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望什么呢 4.3 4.4之类的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you hoping for? Like, 4.3, 4.4?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.02,0:24:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 你也从你的游戏好友那里得分啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unh-unh. You get points from your gaming buddies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.64,0:24:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一码事 我的目标更高 别老打击我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the same thing. Don't shit on me for aiming higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.28,0:24:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹈鹕湾公寓就算是高目标了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pelican Cove higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.81,0:24:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹈鹕湾公寓怎么了 那是很好的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with Pelican Cove? They're great apartments!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.60,0:24:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不过是充满假笑的牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are fake-smile jail cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.64,0:24:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 车被取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Car cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.04,0:24:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还给了我低分 我得重新叫车 还被给了差评\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he marked me down so now I have to book another, and I took a ding.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.51,0:24:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好 - 抱歉 但你以前正常的时候多好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Great job. - I am sorry, but I miss the normal you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.23,0:24:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你沉迷于此之前 我们还会好好聊天 还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before this obsession, when we had conversations, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.55,0:24:26.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得拿上充电器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need my charger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.27,0:24:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个评分系统 只是在把你和那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole ranking thing, just comparing yourself to people who…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.04,0:24:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看见我的充电器了吗 - 那些假装很开心的人比来比去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you seen my charger? - …only pretend to be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.52,0:24:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了不要借这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said don't borrow this!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,像奈奥米那样四星精英 我打赌她们的内心八成痛苦得想自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}High fours like Naomi, I bet they're suicidal on the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.09,0:24:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的车到了 第二次\N{\fnArial\fs30}My car is here. Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.94,0:24:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的鹈鹕湾押金 能退吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Pelican Cove deposit, is it refundable?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.18,0:24:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这行不通怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, what if this doesn't work?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.69,0:24:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能别管我的破事吗 - 你是我的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't you just stay out of my shit? - You're my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.76,0:24:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 如果你真的在意我 或许你应该注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! And if you cared about that, maybe you would've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.57,0:24:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你住在一起对我来说并非乐事\N{\fnArial\fs30}living with you hasn't been one big rainbow sandwich for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.43,0:24:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么我从来不带男生回家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why I never brought any guys back here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.19,0:25:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不想让他们知道我在和一个三分先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I didn't want them to know I was sharing a skanky-ass cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.80,0:25:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,分享一个脏乱不堪的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Mr. Three Point Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.55,0:25:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你表演顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck with your performance!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.32,0:25:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嗨 嗨 我来了 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, hi! I'm coming. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.62,0:25:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 搞毛啊 - 噢 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus Christ! - Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.25,0:25:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.46,0:26:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.00,0:26:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nay-Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.21,0:26:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 莱希 就看看你怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Lace! Just checking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.41,0:26:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在去机场的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my way to the airport right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.17,0:26:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 太好了 你准备好晚宴彩排了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, cool, and you're all good for the rehearsal dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.83,0:26:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然啦 坐飞机大概一个小时就到了 餐厅看起来棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. The flight's, what, an hour? That restaurant looks so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯哼 你准备好裙子了吗 - 嗯 为了以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. And you got the dress okay? - Mm-hmm. In my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.75,0:26:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢粉色 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love the pink. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.18,0:26:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后修改的演讲稿很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the latest draft of the speech is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.17,0:26:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,手写讲稿实在太酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going handwritten's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.21,0:26:40.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些扫描件 我的天 我都快哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those scans of the page, my God, I welled up just at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.77,0:26:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 谢谢 - 嗯 有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, thank you! - Um… just one thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.91,0:26:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是在讲稿中写我帮助你克服进食障碍的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}That whole bit where I help you with the eating disorder thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.53,0:26:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你觉得那有点 - 有点过度分享了 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think that's a little… - A little over-sharing, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.72,0:26:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得一点都没错 我删了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so right. It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.94,0:26:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 棒 几小时后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Cool. Well, I'll see you in a few hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.65,0:26:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 明天我要结婚了 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm getting married tomorrow. ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.81,0:27:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是你的小费 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And here's your tip. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.82,0:27:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.20,0:27:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家注意一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I have your attention, please…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.54,0:27:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 最近怎么样 - 非常棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi there, how are you doing? - I am wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.00,0:27:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 那班航班被取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry, that flight is cancelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.59,0:27:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 不 - 顾客事务中心在另一头\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No, no, no. - Customer incident at the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.94,0:27:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 下班飞机是什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… So when is the next flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.78,0:27:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 今天航班全部客满了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're all kind of full.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.92,0:27:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好几周前订的机票 我要去参加我挚友的婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… I booked this weeks ago. It's my best friend's wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.37,0:27:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 我必须得去 必须的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. - I have to get there. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.58,0:27:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我看看有什么法子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay… let's see what we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.72,0:27:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 太感谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.52,0:28:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到在另一架今晚起飞的飞机上有一个备用座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see there's one standby seat on another plane leaving tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.00,0:28:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.84,0:28:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是为我们的精英飞行项目的会员预留的座位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's reserved for members of our Prime Flight Programme.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.28,0:28:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得达到4.2以上的评分才有资格坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be a 4.2 or over to qualify.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.42,0:28:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 我 我是4.2分 - 啊哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I'm… I'm a 4.2. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.15,0:28:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是4.183分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid you're actually a 4.183.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.61,0:28:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 那不是我的错 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, that's not my fault. Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.00,0:28:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个女人给了我差评 你就不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some woman dinged me down in the… Can't you just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 如果评分不到标准 系统不会允许我订票的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, it won't let me book it without the correct ranking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.08,0:28:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我的评分那么接近 - 我什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it's so close. - There's just nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.52,0:28:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 我是说 当然 - 我得请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Christ, I mean, surely. - I'm gonna have to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.12,0:28:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整一下你的措辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}to moderate your language there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.36,0:28:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.72,0:28:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是首席伴娘 我不能错过婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm maid of honour. I cannot miss this wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.10,0:28:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am so sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.69,0:28:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能叫你的主管来吗 - 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you call the supervisor? - I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.52,0:28:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能叫你的主管来吗 - 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you just call the supervisor? - I cannot do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.37,0:28:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 特么的快给主管打电话 - 好吧 那是脏话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Call the fucking supervisor! - Okay, that's profanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.29,0:29:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不能容忍爆粗口 - 抱歉 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're zero tolerance on profanity. - I'm sorry. It's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得接待下一位乘客了 - 不 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have to serve the next customer. - No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.17,0:29:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能走到旁边吗 女士 - 天呐 特么的快来帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you step away, ma'am? - God, just fucking help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.32,0:29:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.57,0:29:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.56,0:29:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经打电话叫保安了 - 噢 不 不 不 拜托千万别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've called security. - Oh, no, no, no. Please don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.16,0:29:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你五星好评 五星\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh… five-starring you. Five stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.25,0:29:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这里出什么事了 汉娜 - 她恐吓我 说脏话侮辱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the issue here, Hannah? - Intimidation and profanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.54,0:29:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 没有 没有 我并没有恐吓你 - 闭嘴 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, no. I was not intimidating. - Don't speak, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.78,0:29:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只不过 - 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was just trying to… - Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.57,0:29:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 所以 为了恢复现场秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, in order to restore calm,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.28,0:29:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为惩罚 我将动用我机场保安的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm invoking my authority as airport security.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.60,0:29:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你扣掉整整一分\N{\fnArial\fs30}to dock you one full ranking point as a punitive measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.45,0:29:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是暂时措施 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is a temporary measure. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.56,0:29:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的评分会在24小时内恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your score reverts to normal in 24 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.28,0:29:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 但我现在就需要评分\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. But I need it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.40,0:29:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这期间 所有差评会乘两倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}During this period, all down votes are subject to a times two multiplier.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.69,0:29:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,两倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Times two?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.71,0:29:47.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们推荐你在这段时间避免消极评价\N{\fnArial\fs30}We recommend you avoid negative feedback at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.09,0:29:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会被双倍扣分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on double damage?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.15,0:29:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请您马上离开机场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, remove yourself from the airport immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.87,0:30:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 由于您的评分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, due to your ranking…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.25,0:30:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 恰克 好名字啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi there. Chuck! Great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.36,0:30:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 今晚过得还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Hope you're having a great night.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.17,0:30:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 挺好的 - 我要租一辆车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's pretty good. - So I need a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.09,0:30:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 您有想要的车型吗 - 什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a vehicle in mind? - Anything, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.03,0:30:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 由于您当前的排位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, due to your current ranking,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.79,0:30:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能给您我们的特廉车队\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're restricted to our super saver fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.68,0:30:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊 这样啊 好 - I-巡航者2号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yep. That's… Yeah. - I-Cruiser 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.02,0:31:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这年头还有2号啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}They still have the 2?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.24,0:31:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.35,0:31:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.34,0:31:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.67,0:32:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们在艺术夏令营里 只是才五岁的小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little girl, who when we were both five years old in art camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.32,0:32:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,主动找我说话 因为她看见我害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}started talking to me because she saw I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.96,0:32:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她帮我做了破布先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl who helped me make Mr. Rags…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.96,0:32:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,此时该落泪 人群为你狂热 你可以做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teardrop. Crowd goes wild. You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.47,0:32:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉啊 我保证我已经在路上了 - 你到哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, okay, I swear I'm on my way. - How far away are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.28,0:32:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 还有点远呢 我错过了航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Quite a ways. I missed my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.14,0:32:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么 - 呃 也不算错过 就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Well, not missed it but…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.92,0:32:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你赶不上晚宴彩排了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're not gonna make the rehearsal dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.62,0:32:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 赶不上了 - 莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Lacie!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.99,0:33:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在很抱歉 今天真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry. It's been…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.31,0:33:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我租了一辆车 正往那边开呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a rental car. I'm driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.88,0:33:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,开车 这得开九个小时吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving? That's like nine hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.78,0:33:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开得很快的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm making good time,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.20,0:33:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,开上一夜 就当是公路旅行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}gonna go through the night, make a road trip out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.89,0:33:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么问题吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是有的话我可以找人替你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can find a replacement if something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.90,0:33:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别 我会准时到的 我以破布先生的名义发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No. No. I'll be there. I swear on Mr. Rags.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.60,0:33:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈哈哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.74,0:33:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 路上小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just drive safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.64,0:33:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定的 我就\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet. I'll just…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.59,0:33:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.16,0:33:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.59,0:33:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.95,0:33:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.12,0:34:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.06,0:34:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.43,0:35:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.08,0:35:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的充电器跟我的车不匹配\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your charger doesn't fit my car.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.60,0:35:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这种车现在可少见了 - 是租的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't see those around much these days. - It's a rental.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.66,0:35:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的充电器是Q2Z型的 你的是K1型 他们没给你适配器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ours chargers are Q2Z, yours one's a K1. They didn't give you an adapter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.84,0:35:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 你们这儿有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Do you have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.80,0:35:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我这没有 你到处问问吧 - 好吧 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not in here. Ask around. - Thanks, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.63,0:35:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮大忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're super helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.93,0:35:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,两星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two stars?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.45,0:35:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么给我打两星\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.24,0:35:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚不算什么有意义的交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't a meaningful encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.84,0:35:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.47,0:35:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.87,0:36:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你有K1型适配器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a K1 adapter, by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.52,0:36:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 女士 请问有K1型适配器吗 要不看看后备箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, how about you, a K1 adapter, perhaps, in the trunk of your car?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.56,0:36:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.49,0:36:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.23,0:36:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 女士 你好 请问你有K1型适配器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ma'am, hi. Do you have a K1 adapter?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.76,0:36:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我租了一辆车 它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a rental car. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.07,0:37:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 慢点 让她搭个便车吧 - 她的评分才2.8\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Slow down. Let's give her a ride. - She's, like, 2.8.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.26,0:37:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.79,0:37:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都没干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't even do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.46,0:37:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像需要搭车啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you need a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.04,0:37:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.04,0:37:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 不用了 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.06,0:37:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着可不像没事 上来吧 我不咬人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look it. Come on. I don't bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.10,0:38:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有啤酒 咖啡 红酒 威士忌 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, Mrs. Coffee, reds, whiskey. Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.48,0:38:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.50,0:38:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.16,0:38:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 尽量到玛丽港附近就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Just as close as you can get to Port Mary would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.40,0:38:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,想从我发的东西里看出我是不是危险人物吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking my feed for danger signs?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.34,0:38:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,常有的事 才1.4分 肯定是个反社会的疯子 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it a lot. 1.4 gotta be an antisocial maniac, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.03,0:38:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看起来 - 正常吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You seem… - Normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.56,0:38:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.36,0:38:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了点心思的 你怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took some effort. What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.54,0:38:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说 你2.8分 但看起来不像2.8啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you're a 2.8, but you don't look 2.8.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.64,0:38:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个不是 这是暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not… This is temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.54,0:38:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会升上去的 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm gonna turn it around. - Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.56,0:38:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去参加一个婚礼 我是首席伴娘 - 挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going to a wedding. Maid of honour. - Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.28,0:38:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听听我的致辞吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna hear my speech?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.56,0:39:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.93,0:39:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你是怎么掉到2.8的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how come you're a 2.8?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.31,0:39:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,唉 我在机场因为吼人被罚分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got marked down at the airport for yelling,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.88,0:39:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还被上了双倍扣分的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they put me on double damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.62,0:39:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉怎么样 - 糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did it feel? - Awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.51,0:39:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说吼人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I meant the yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.76,0:39:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不晓得 我当时很生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I was mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.18,0:39:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是把我害惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at where it got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.20,0:39:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只要我赶上了婚礼 做好我的致辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as long as I get to the wedding, do the speech,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.23,0:39:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就不会在意我的2.8了 我毕竟是跟新娘一起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll overlook the 2.8. I'm with the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.42,0:39:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我干得好 那些人可都是接近五分的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I do well, well, they're all high fours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.54,0:39:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的评分曲线就能往上走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that velocitates my arc.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.07,0:39:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后等我的罚分取消了 我的平均分能涨一大截\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once they lift the point penalty, well, my average goes way up,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.71,0:39:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 嗯 会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, yeah, it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.52,0:39:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,天 你跟我还真像\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you remind me of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.47,0:39:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 唔 - 不是现在的我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hmm. - Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.98,0:39:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经 到过4.6分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was, uh… 4.6 once.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.86,0:40:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 4.6 - 当时评分就是天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 4.6? - Used to live for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.70,0:40:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那叫一个拼命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the work I put in…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.95,0:40:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,八年前 我老公汤姆 得了癌症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight years ago, Tom, my husband, got cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.60,0:40:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是胰腺癌 非常糟心 到了晚期才出现症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was pancreatic. It was a real bitch. The symptoms showed up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.53,0:40:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.30,0:40:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱俩并不认识 你不是真心难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me so you're not really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.66,0:40:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要是因为我突然开始讲癌症 让你觉得尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just mainly awkward 'cause I have sprung some cancer talk at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.96,0:40:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我给每个医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I five-starred every doctor,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.45,0:40:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个护士 每个四星精英的顾问都打了五星\N{\fnArial\fs30}every nurse, every high-four consultant that we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.12,0:40:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,叮 叮 叮 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding. Ding. Ding. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.91,0:40:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而癌症才不管你呢 该扩散还是扩散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cancer didn't give a shit. It just kept growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.95,0:40:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,几个月后 我们听说了一种实验性的疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}A couple of months in, we heard about this experimental treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.61,0:40:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常昂贵 只对极少数人开放\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was very expensive. It was very exclusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.48,0:40:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我竭尽全力想给他争取一个名额\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did everything I could to get him a spot there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.92,0:40:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆当时的评分是4.3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tom was a 4.3.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.00,0:41:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们把他的床位给了一个4.4分的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave his bed to a 4.4.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.56,0:41:11.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以当他过世的时候 我想 去他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when he died I thought, fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.40,0:41:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始在任何场合都直言不讳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started saying what I wanted, when I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.15,0:41:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么就说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just drop it out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.76,0:41:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种做法并不讨喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一旦开始这么做 你的评分\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is incredible how fast you slip off the ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.56,0:41:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会飞速下滑\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you start doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.42,0:41:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现我有很多朋友都不喜欢诚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It turned out a lot of my friends didn't care for honesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.92,0:41:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我的态度就像是我在他们的早餐桌上拉了一坨粑粑似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treated me like I had taken a shit at their breakfast table.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.75,0:41:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 天啊 有话直说的感觉棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Jesus Christ, it felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.95,0:41:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,摆脱那些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shedding those fuckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.91,0:41:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像脱掉挤脚的鞋一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was like taking off tight shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.40,0:41:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 或许你该试试 - 哦 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe you should try it? - Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.27,0:41:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.72,0:41:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能踢掉鞋子 就这么光着脚走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't just kick off my shoes and walk the earth or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.48,0:42:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不试试怎么知道 - 只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won't know unless you try. - Oh, that's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.15,0:42:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你的人生原本丰富多彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you had something with your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.08,0:42:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实的 美好的时光 你却全部失去了 我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}real things, good things, and you lost it all, and I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.05,0:42:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在你已经没什么可丢弃的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you've got nothing left to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.69,0:42:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我甚至都没有什么值得丢弃的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't even have the something worth losing, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.54,0:42:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我仍在为此努力奋斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I mean, I'm still fighting for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.69,0:42:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- “此”是指什么 - 我不知道 能让我感觉充实的人生吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what is "that"? - I don't know. Enough to be content?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.28,0:42:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 环顾四周 心里想 我过得还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, to look around and think, well, I guess I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.33,0:42:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,能好好地松一口气 而不是感觉 感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be able to breathe out, not feeling like… like…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.40,0:42:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉 而这个境界还太遥远了 太太遥远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like just… And that is way off, like, way, way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.52,0:42:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到达之前 我还是得玩数字游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And until I get there, I have to play the numbers game.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.02,0:42:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都得这样 环境就是如此 这个该死的世界就是这么运转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all do, that's what we're in. That's how the fucking world works.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.64,0:43:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 或许你不记得了 你只是年纪太大无法理解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, maybe you don't remember, you know, you're just too old to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.26,0:43:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是那个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not mean that how it sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.60,0:43:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我不会给你差评的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I'm not voting you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.96,0:43:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝儿 - 几点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sweetheart. - What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.50,0:43:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从这里要往东走了 你得找别人搭便车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm heading east from here so I think you need to get yourself another ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.73,0:43:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在哪里 - 距离玛丽港口30英里远\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - About 30 miles from Port Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.03,0:43:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边有很多公交车 你会一切顺利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of buses stop here so you should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.41,0:43:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯 谢谢你 - 祝你致辞成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, thank you. - Good luck with your speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.12,0:43:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你在里面放了点小东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put a little something in there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.00,0:44:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是嘛 - 紧急逃离舱口\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You did? - Emergency escape hatch!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.86,0:44:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.72,0:44:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个世界上 我们都过于关注\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this world, we're all so caught up…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.88,0:44:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己演的独角戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in our own dramas.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.12,0:44:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爸 - 很容易忽视了真正重要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, Dad was like… - It's easy to forget what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.47,0:44:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从来没有听说过这个剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd never even heard of the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.87,0:44:35.34,Title,0,0,0,0,,我说 “你居然从来没听说过《宁静海》”\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm like, "You never heard of Sea of Tranquillity?"
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.60,0:44:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是最棒的科幻作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, the number-one sci-fi fantasy,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.80,0:44:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他只会说“什么鬼” 算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's all like, "What the fuck?" Whatever!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.24,0:44:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我对这种紫色有点过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm allergic to this purple.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.95,0:44:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我就说 “我要去玛丽港口的宁静海剧迷大会\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm like, "Well, I'm going to Tranquillity Con in Port Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.44,0:44:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才打扮成达斯特中尉”\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I'm dressed like Lieutenant Duster."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.75,0:44:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一脸 “呃 玛丽港口好几英里远啊”\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's all like, "Uh… Port Mary is frickin' miles away."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.16,0:44:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,啥啥啥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yadda, yadda, yadda.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.09,0:44:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给我打了一颗星 呃 谢了 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He one-stars me. Like, thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.88,0:44:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回去再见 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you back on there. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.99,0:45:07.55,Title,0,0,0,0,,你们是要去《宁静海》剧迷大会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you guys headed to Tranquillity Con?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.00,0:45:11.06,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢《宁静号》么 - 骨灰级粉丝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're into Sea of Tranquillity? - Totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.07,0:45:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都准备好过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was all set to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.47,0:45:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个朋友 拿着我的服装 已经过去了 但是我的车抛锚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, who is there already, has my costume, but my car broke down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.09,0:45:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的房车里还有位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's some space in the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.80,0:45:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.88,0:45:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是宁粉 对吧 - 抱歉你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a Trank head, huh? - Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.92,0:45:37.24,Title,0,0,0,0,,宁粉 《宁静海》的粉丝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trank head. Sea of Tranquillity fan?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.30,0:45:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对的 我们那边一般都说宁饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. We say Tranksters where I'm from.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.78,0:45:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最喜欢的角色是谁 - 必须是达斯特中尉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's your favourite character? - Gotta be Lieutenant Duster.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.84,0:45:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她太牛逼了 - 她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's awesome. - She?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.53,0:45:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 我说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He! I misspoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.16,0:45:51.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,达斯特中尉没有固定的性别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lieutenant Duster has no fixed gender.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.56,0:45:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 所以才很难记住 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, and that's why it's so hard to remember, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.73,0:45:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 接个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Gotta get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.98,0:45:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友 正在大会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend, at the convention.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.79,0:46:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.83,0:46:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 昨晚太疯狂了 不过我已经快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, oh, my God, insane night, but I am so close now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.28,0:46:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.83,0:46:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 不不不 我再一个小时就到了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No. No. I'm, like, an hour away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.72,0:46:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别来了 我不想让你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't come. I don't want you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.59,0:46:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你怎么了 但是我不能让一个2.6分的人出现在我的婚礼上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what is up with you, but I cannot have a 2.6 at my wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.34,0:46:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是暂时的 暂时的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, that's temporary! That's temporary.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.48,0:46:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,婚礼就在今天 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the wedding's today so…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.76,0:46:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是这也没改变什么啊 - 莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But it doesn't change anything. - Lacie…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.36,0:46:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是能致辞的 - 莱希\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can still do the same speech. - Lacie…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.51,0:46:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有破布先生 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And there's Mr. Rags! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.56,0:46:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 但是你邀请了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… But you invited me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.53,0:46:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过宾客名单了 他们都是 4.5分或者以上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen the guest list. They are all, like, 4.5 or above.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.21,0:46:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到你这个2.6分会爆炸的 我承受不了那种伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are going to freak at a 2.6, and I am not taking that kind of damage,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.71,0:46:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加上我有大概六个月 没下降到4.7了\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus I haven't dipped under a 4.7 in, like, six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.93,0:46:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你想见见交情最久的老朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you wanted your oldest friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.41,0:46:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我请你发言的时候 你是4.2分 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I asked you to speak, you were a 4.2, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.54,0:46:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,请一个四星出头的老朋友出现在这样的场合 这种真实性\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the authenticity of a vintage bond low four at a gathering of this calibre.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.93,0:46:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们做的所有模拟中 效果都非常完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}played fantastically on all the stimulations we ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.00,0:47:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,预测至少都能给我们加上0.2分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forecast was a prestige bounce of 0.2 minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.52,0:47:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在你连三分都不到了 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now you're a sub three. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.86,0:47:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只会激起过多得流言蜚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just puts the stink on things a little too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.67,0:47:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我们来说是负面影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just plays badly for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.37,0:47:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以这一切对你来说只是数字么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it was just about numbers for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.44,0:47:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 别装了 对咱俩来说都只是数字好么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cut the shit! It was numbers for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.51,0:47:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也想让精英们给你好评的 别否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted those primo votes, don't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.56,0:47:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己又没法获得精英的评分 别自欺欺人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like you could get them on your own. Let's not kid ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.44,0:47:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我会让他们给我好评的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm… I'm getting those votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.99,0:47:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样 你就打算随随便便地出现 让大家都喜欢你么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You're just gonna roll up here and make people like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.48,0:47:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 我要去致辞 - 不 你不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. I'm doing my speech. - No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.11,0:47:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去 而且他们听过之后 会给我疯狂点赞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am. And they are gonna vote me through the roof when they hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.57,0:47:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们会感动得泪流满面的 - 你给我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Weep their fucking eyes out! - Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.49,0:47:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.23,0:47:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.87,0:47:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来没看过你们那个傻逼剧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never seen your stupid fucking show.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.64,0:48:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望它被砍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope they cancel it!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.07,0:48:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要搭个便车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.77,0:48:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.87,0:48:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.11,0:48:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.03,0:48:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.92,0:48:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能借用一下你的摩托车吗 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I borrow your bike? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.44,0:48:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,能借用一下你的摩托车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I borrow your bike?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.71,0:48:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奥米•杰恩•布雷斯托 你是否愿意 让这个男人成为你的丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you, Naomi Jayne Blestow, take this man to be your husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.71,0:48:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵守婚姻契约 与他一起生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}to live together with him in the covenant of marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.36,0:49:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱他 慰藉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}To love him, comfort him,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.57,0:49:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬他 守护他 不论健康疾病\N{\fnArial\fs30}honour and keep him, in sickness and in health…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.35,0:49:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛弃一切 忠诚于他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and forsaking all others, be faithful unto him…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.24,0:50:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,敬我最好的兄弟 安东尼 他是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To my best mate, Anthony. Let's hear it for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.26,0:50:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,打一开始你就在我身边 我爱你 兄弟 感谢你陪我一路走来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been there from day one. I love you, man. I appreciate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.60,0:50:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你的致辞太有趣了 以你的标准来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hilarious speech, by the way. By your standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.62,0:50:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乓乓乓 - 哦哦哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pow! Pow! Pow! - Oh! Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.94,0:50:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还留着几发子弹 哦 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still got a few bullets left. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.22,0:50:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, gosh, well, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.57,0:50:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.98,0:50:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有很多想感谢的人 我们美丽的伴娘团\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have so many people to thank. Our beautiful bridesmaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.59,0:50:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.23,0:50:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最真诚 最温暖的感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}my most heartfelt thanks, my warmest thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.32,0:50:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要送给我最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}are to someone who's my best friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.41,0:51:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的爱人 如今我可以自豪地宣布 我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lover and now, I'm honoured to say, my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.18,0:51:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,奈奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.00,0:51:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 奈奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three! Naomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.83,0:51:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,冠军之队\N{\fnArial\fs30}The A Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.62,0:51:19.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太爱你了 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you so much, darl.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.06,0:51:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 哇哦 哇哦 哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-whoo-whoo-whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.06,0:51:22.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.52,0:51:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 不 应该谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.60,0:51:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,到这边来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.74,0:51:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快滚过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your ass over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.34,0:51:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 小兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in here, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.24,0:51:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帅爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.17,0:51:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶 来击个掌 选的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! Gimme five! Good choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.02,0:51:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这他妈是你应得的 真他妈是你应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You fucking earned it, man. You fucking earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.82,0:51:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.66,0:51:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 我的天啊 - 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.70,0:51:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家能安静一下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can everyone be quiet for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.62,0:52:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.43,0:52:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把她弄走 - 那样影响太不好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get rid of her. - That would play awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.78,0:52:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,她他妈只能得1.1分\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a fucking 1.1.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.87,0:52:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想对那些不认识我的人说 那个 你们都不认识我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now for those of you who don't know me, which is… all of you…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.44,0:52:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫莱希•庞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}my name is Lacie Pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.47,0:52:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们信不信 我是奈奥米交情最久的朋友之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, believe it or not, I am one of Naomi's oldest friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.91,0:52:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 奈奈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Nay-Nay!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.32,0:52:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你 保罗 我听说过很多你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's great to meet you too, Paul. I've heard a lot about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.79,0:52:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可是个大人物 那个保罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a pretty big deal, that Paul.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.42,0:52:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.94,0:52:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能自己做橄榄酱 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He makes his own tapenade! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.08,0:52:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.90,0:52:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说 呃 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, um… I…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.18,0:52:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一辈子都很向往奈奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}have looked up to Naomi pretty much my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.34,0:52:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我们五岁第一次见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met when we were five years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.22,0:52:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到十几岁的时候 我们俩简直是一对无敌组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}and right up through to our teenage years, we made quite the pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.72,0:52:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们聊各种女生话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd talk about all the things girls talk about,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.37,0:53:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 男孩 发型 小玩意儿 呃 还是男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, boys, hair, products, uh… more boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.62,0:53:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我会尝试稍微聊聊别的话题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I tried sometimes to expand our range a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.57,0:53:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如气候变化 但是她觉得有些无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and talk about climate change, but she found that kind of boring so…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.01,0:53:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.81,0:53:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能是对的 我是说 地球算啥啊 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was probably right. I mean, fuck the planet, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.09,0:53:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.15,0:53:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢你 来吧 我们嗨起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you! Come on. Let's have a little fun here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.96,0:53:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们懂的 地球算个毛啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, fuck the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.04,0:53:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它作死啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the planet!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.10,0:53:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.13,0:53:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子几乎一直都在向往奈奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… looked up to Naomi pretty much my entire life,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.08,0:53:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说她一直在居高临下地鄙视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}which meant she was looking down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.22,0:53:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,脸上倒是永远带笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always with a smile though.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.28,0:53:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上高中的时候 她是我可以靠着哭的臂膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}In high school, she was my shoulder to cry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.77,0:53:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好像很喜欢那样 我跟男生总是没法顺利交往\N{\fnArial\fs30}She seemed to enjoy that. Guys and me never worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.76,0:54:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到奈奥米就就会这样 然后你们懂的 就没有然后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd see Naomi and just… Whoo! You know, that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.81,0:54:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有紧绷绷的小翘臀\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had this tight ass,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.36,0:54:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像两个小拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}like two fists.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.25,0:54:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.84,0:54:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was all like…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.16,0:54:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was like…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.76,0:54:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿过学校的走廊\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the hallways in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.17,0:54:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她却在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she was there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.19,0:54:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我跪在马桶前呕吐的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holding my hair back…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.29,0:54:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我挽起头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I knelt, vomiting, in front of the crapper.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.16,0:55:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对此我很感谢 奈奥米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for that, Naomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.77,0:55:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直希望我是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always wished I was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.83,0:55:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.17,0:55:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜那就是你一直和我待在一起的原因吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's why you kept me around so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.61,0:55:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一天你有了新工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until you got your new job.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.61,0:55:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你高大上的新朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your fancy new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.92,0:55:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.92,0:55:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,操他妈的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…fucking… jackhole!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.78,0:55:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就不需要我了 你可能已经找到了我的替代品\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't need me. You probably got another me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.12,0:55:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你又像女妖一样勾搭上了新的小婊子闺蜜了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess there's some other "yeth Beth" you moved on to like a succubus.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.79,0:55:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要说到破布先生了 好吗 日\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting to Mr. Rags, okay? Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.23,0:55:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.48,0:55:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我特么后退 我会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the fuck back! I'll kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.88,0:56:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把他的头切下来 塞进屁眼里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cut his head off and stick it up my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.07,0:56:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间马上就要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time's nearly up!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.64,0:56:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 冷静一点 - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! Calm down. - I…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.04,0:56:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想说 在这个深陷于我们自身麻烦的世界里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to say, in this world so caught up in our own shit,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.92,0:56:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不要忘记了最重要的东西 - 没事的 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- let's not forget what matters. - It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.12,0:56:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸福 去你妈的保罗和奈奥米 她就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happiness, fucking Paul and Naomi, and she's…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.39,0:56:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,她 她干了格雷格\N{\fnArial\fs30}She… She fucked Greg!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.36,0:56:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道她这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.20,0:56:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你这么做了 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know you did. - No…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.26,0:56:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even try to deny…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.82,0:56:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们在艺术夏令营里 只是才五岁的小女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The little girl who, when we were just five-years-old in art camp,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.36,0:56:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她主动和我说话 只因为看出了我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}started talking to me because she saw I was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.64,0:56:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还帮我做了破布先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}and helped me make Mr. Rags.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.76,0:56:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让我时时想起你 想起你对我是多么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}He reminds me of you and what you meant to me then!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.76,0:56:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很荣幸能在这里见证你的狗屁婚礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm so honoured to be here to see this shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.21,0:57:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 奈奈 我一直爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, Nay-Nay! I've always loved you!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.48,0:57:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.07,0:59:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈在看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.28,0:59:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just what I was wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.41,0:59:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.14,1:00:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.81,1:00:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别什么 别疑惑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't? Don't wonder?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.27,1:00:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.64,1:00:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有疑惑这将是个无聊的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be a dull world without wonder.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.92,1:00:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你的世界一点也不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a shit about your world.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.57,1:00:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你的胸罩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like your brassiere.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.92,1:00:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你的胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like your moustache.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.72,1:00:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你的气场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like your aura.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.68,1:00:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的气场 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My aura? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.71,1:00:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你的 头\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like your… head.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.59,1:00:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个头是什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your entire head is just ridiculous to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.68,1:00:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.59,1:00:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来就像一个醉酒成性 过气的气象播报员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like an alcoholic former weatherman.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.52,1:00:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听起来就像一只就像刚听说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like a lost little lamb.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.03,1:00:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界上没有圣诞老人的迷路的小羔羊\N{\fnArial\fs30}that just got told there's no Santa Claus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.75,1:00:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈是被哪个卡通人物上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of cartoon character did your mum have to fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.52,1:00:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,才生出的你这个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}to brew you up in the womb?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.33,1:00:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我像是生出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I look like I was born,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.95,1:00:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是在地下实验室被一头受虐待的奶牛拉出来的屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}not shit out by some tormented cow creature in an underground lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.55,1:01:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还被那个实验室丢出去了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got tossed out of that lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.31,1:01:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 是吗 - 噢 是啊 直接从马桶里冲下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? - Oh, yeah, flushed out.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.92,1:01:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 掉在垃圾堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh! - In the trash!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.79,1:01:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的脸他妈像是 - 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your face is a fucking… - Fucking.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.16,1:01:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的生化爆炸的车祸现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking biological car crash.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.39,1:01:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让毕加索翻白眼 然后说\N{\fnArial\fs30}that made Picasso screw his eyes up and say,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.56,1:01:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,““呵呵 根本看不懂”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Well, that just don't make sense."
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.78,1:01:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你他妈就是个混蛋 - 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're a fucking asshole. - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.40,1:01:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下周三干死你 - 圣诞节榨干你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you next Wednesday. - Fuck you for Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.30,1:01:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 操死你 - 日翻你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck you! - Fuck you!
